      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I haven't tested this, but there is a SetAvatarAudioForceSpatial(bool force) which allows you to force the audio source to be spatial and SetAvatarAudioCustomCurve(bool allow) which allows you to enforce a preset curve made by VRChat or the custom curve given by the avatar creator.",
